  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Clear yellow urine drips from your adversary’s weapon as he withdraws it from your body. He just punctured your bladder! A faint smell of ammonia spreads around you.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2). Fortunately for you, urine is mostly sterile so you only contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.1hQuVFZt9QnnbWzg]{Minor Infection} from this violation of your bodily integrity. Also, until the wound has closed in a week or so you are prone to leaking, which reduces your Fellowship by -10 whenever you are near anyone with a sense of smell.</p>"
    },
